<section
    class="w-full max-w-[1200px] mx-auto bg-gray-900 rounded-[2.5rem] p-8 md:p-16 text-center text-white relative overflow-hidden shadow-lg"
>
    <div
        class="absolute top-0 left-0 w-full h-full bg-[radial-gradient(circle_at_center,_#374151_0%,_transparent_45%)] pointer-events-none opacity-50"
    >
    </div>

    <div class="relative z-10 max-w-3xl mx-auto">
        <h2 class="text-3xl md:text-5xl font-bold mb-6 tracking-tight">
            Suscríbete a nosotros
        </h2>
        <p
            class="text-gray-300 text-lg mb-10 max-w-2xl mx-auto leading-relaxed"
        >
            Únete a nuestra comunidad. Podras estar al tondo de lo que pasa en
            el mundo de la música, cine y noticias.
        </p>

        <form class="max-w-md mx-auto flex flex-col gap-4">
            <input
                type="text"
                placeholder="Tu nombre sin apellidos"
                class="w-full px-8 py-4 rounded-full text-gray-900 bg-white placeholder-gray-500 focus:outline-none focus:ring-4 focus:ring-gray-600 transition-shadow"
            />
            <input
                type="email"
                placeholder="Tu correo electrónico"
                class="w-full px-8 py-4 rounded-full text-gray-900 bg-white placeholder-gray-500 focus:outline-none focus:ring-4 focus:ring-gray-600 transition-shadow"
            />

            <div
                class="flex items-start justify-center gap-3 text-sm text-gray-400 mt-4 text-left md:text-center"
            >
                <input
                    type="checkbox"
                    class="mt-1 accent-white w-4 h-4"
                /><label
                    >He leído y acepto el <a
                        href="#"
                        class="text-white underline hover:text-gray-200"
                        >Aviso Legal</a
                    > y <a
                        href="#"
                        class="text-white underline hover:text-gray-200"
                        >Política de Privacidad</a
                    >
                </label>
            </div>

            <button
                type="submit"
                class="mt-8 px-10 py-4 rounded-full border-2 border-white text-white font-bold text-lg tracking-wide hover:bg-white hover:text-gray-900 transition-all duration-300 mx-auto inline-block"
                >Enviar
            </button>
        </form>
    </div>
</section>
